  "prefLabel": "Per 102.45 In-band advancement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.45 “In-band advancement” means an increase in pay within a pay band, with no change in job title or position number, awarded upon satisfaction of criteria specific to the job title and separate from an increment resulting under Per 901.03.\n\nSource. #13667, eff 6-22-23 (see Revision Note #4 at chapter heading for Per 100); renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.39), eff 12-1-25",
